-- statement:
--   **Error of the computed source transform** `F̃ u = 2^γ B̃₀(C̃(Ã u))` against `F u = 2^γ B₀(QF(A u))`, for grid `u` of norm `≤ 1/2`.
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.KFMErr`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem NLogN.KFM.source_err (p : ℕ) (γ : ℕ) {A : (κ → ℂ) → (ι → ℂ)} {QF : (ι → ℂ) → (ι → ℂ)}
--       {B0 : (ι → ℂ) → (κ → ℂ)} (hA : LinC A) (hQF : LinC QF) (hB : LinC B0)
--       {At : (κ → ℂ) → (ι → ℂ)} {Ct : (ι → ℂ) → (ι → ℂ)} {B0t : (ι → ℂ) → (κ → ℂ)}
--       (εA Ec εB : ℝ)
--       (hAt : ∀ u, Grid p u → ‖u‖ ≤ 1 / 2 → ‖At u - A u‖ ≤ εA * hp p ∧ Grid p (At u))
--       (hCt : ∀ x, Grid p x → ‖x‖ ≤ 6 / 10 → ‖Ct x - QF x‖ ≤ Ec * hp p ∧ ‖Ct x‖ ≤ 1 ∧ Grid p (Ct x))
--       (hBt : ∀ y, Grid p y → ‖y‖ ≤ 1 → ‖B0t y - B0 y‖ ≤ εB * hp p)
--       (hεA : εA * hp p ≤ 1 / 10)
--       {u : κ → ℂ} (hu : Grid p u) (hu1 : ‖u‖ ≤ 1 / 2) :
--       ‖(2 : ℂ) ^ γ • B0t (Ct (At u)) - (2 : ℂ) ^ γ • B0 (QF (A u))‖ ≤
--         2 ^ γ * ((εA + Ec + εB) * hp p)
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** The lemma belongs to the part *KFM 14: the error chain of the computed pipeline (§9.7.1), abstract form*: Arrays are functions `ι → ℂ` with the sup norm; `hp = 2^{-p}`. Every computed procedure is
--   an arbitrary function with an error bound on grid inputs (`Grid p f`: `Q_p f = f`), so the IL
--   denotations (and `P18IL`) plug in later.
